== Orange Headband ==

You say, 'What Orange Headband?'

: Phin Esrinap says, 'This is a difficult award to obtain. The city of Qeynos is, as you know, under constant attack by the gnolls of Blackburrow. The Silent Fist Clan rewards its members who venture deep into this gnoll stronghold and bring swift justice to these vile creatures. Please return two Blackburrow gnoll pelts - make sure they aren't ruined - and a Blackburrow gnoll skin as proof of your noble actions. Also, turn in your [yellow headband], and then I shall give you the orange one. Good luck.'


Turn these in to '''Phin Esrinap''' in the Silent Fist Clan House in Qeynos. 

* 2x [[Blackburrow Gnoll Pelt]]s - In the second level of Blackburrow you'll find elite guards, commanders, guardsmen, etc. Most of these gnolls have a chance to drop a pelt. Make sure you don't keep any ruined pelts, as they are useless to this quest.
* 1 [[Blackburrow Gnoll Skin]] - These will sometimes drop off elite guards and commanders in Blackburrow. Fairly rare drop, I had to slaughter several spawn points of these types for about an hour before I saw one. The Gnoll Brewer also drops the skin, and has various spawn points.
* 1 Yellow Headband - From prior Quest

: Phin Esrinap says 'Good work, Soandso. You are well on your way toward earning the orange headband.'

