== Blue and Black Headband ==

These items are not the result of any quests. They drop from Monk Guildmasters in Qeynos. The Purple Headband is the highest headband you need to obtain for the [[Robe of the Lost Circle]]. 

== Faction ==

These turn ins require high amiably faction to turn in.  Since all of the items are tradeable, the turn ins can be done on a new monk.  If you want to do the turn ins on an Iksar monk, it will require approximately 1600 gnoll kills.
